            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hobo Power"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yummmm. :) I took the suggestions of other reviewers and used 1 T. of sugar, vanilla yogurt, and 1 t. of vanilla extract. I also threw in a banana. It was out of this world! My mom didn't say much... she was too busy downing the glass. :P But afterwards she commented on how good it was. And it was! Good, that is. :D"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ModestFlan2435"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don't normally leave reviews, but I had to for this! It is SO GOOD!!! Thank you so much for sharing it! I used my mini Magic Bullet for this and just skipped the ice, only used 2 TB of sugar, and used 2% milk instead of skim. Amazing! Will be trying this recipe with other fruits too.",
            "datePublished": "2025-02-21T18:02:36.365Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jackie Ann"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this with 8 frozen strawberries, half a frozen banana, 1/2 cup unsweetened vanilla almond milk, 1/2 cup plain Greek yogurt, 1t vanilla, 2 packets of Truvia, and 1/2 cup water (since all my fruit was frozen). It's a lot of substitutions, but I wanted to make it healthier. It was amazing so I know it will taste amazing if you make it as written. Also, it was runny the way I made it, but I wanted to be able to down it quickly.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-23T16:52:48.450Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "James C Stanton"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Holy ! This thing is phenomenal! The only thing I didn't like was that there was too much yogurt taste at the end. I also added half a banana, and some blueberries. Once again, this thing is PHENOMENAL!!! Would recommend it to anyone in the world, even if they hate strawberries.",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-21T14:35:30.150Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
