              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cech7"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was so easy and delicious! The vanilla taste was strong. Next time I make it I will only use 1 teaspoon. It was also very watery and not thick or creamy. Maybe more yogurt? It was very good, and I will definitely make again!",
            "datePublished": "2020-06-04T16:39:48.857Z"
