              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amber Munoz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's a pretty simple recipe but it's not the exact taste I was looking for. What I usually end up doing is switching out the plain yogurt strawberry and banana yoplait yogurt, and I also usually don't add in the vanilla extract since the yoplait yogurt is usually sweet enough. Also I usually add a little bit more fruit than what they suggest and that always turns out just great. But this is a good base recipe to go off of.",
